<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Aktivasi Akun | Portal Mitra</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center">
  <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg max-w-md w-full mx-4">
    <div class="text-center mb-6">
      <div class="bg-indigo-100 w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
        <i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-8 h-8 text-indigo-600"></i>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Aktivasi Akun Pertama</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2">Halo, <strong><%= mitraName %></strong>! Silakan ganti password sementara Anda dengan password baru yang lebih aman.</p>
    </div>

    <% if (locals.error === 'password_too_short') { %>
      <div class="mb-4 bg-red-50 border border-red-200 text-red-700 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-2">
        <i data-lucide="alert-circle" class="w-5 h-5"></i> Password minimal 8 karakter.
      </div>
    <% } else if (locals.error === 'password_mismatch') { %>
      <div class="mb-4 bg-red-50 border border-red-200 text-red-700 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-2">
        <i data-lucide="alert-circle" class="w-5 h-5"></i> Password tidak cocok.
      </div>
    <% } else if (locals.error) { %>
      <div class="mb-4 bg-red-50 border border-red-200 text-red-700 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-2">
        <i data-lucide="alert-circle" class="w-5 h-5"></i> Terjadi kesalahan.
      </div>
    <% } %>

    <form action="/portal-mitra/change-password" method="POST" class="space-y-4">
      <div>
        <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Password Baru</label>
        <input type="password" name="new_password" required minlength="8"
          class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 outline-none"
          placeholder="Minimal 8 karakter">
      </div>

      <div>
        <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Konfirmasi Password</label>
        <input type="password" name="confirm_password" required minlength="8"
          class="w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 outline-none"
          placeholder="Ulangi password baru">
      </div>

      <button type="submit" 
        class="w-full bg-indigo-600 text-white py-2.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-indigo-700 font-semibold transition">
        Aktivasi Akun
      </button>
    </form>

    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 text-center mt-6">
      Setelah aktivasi, Anda akan diarahkan ke Dashboard Mitra.
    </p>
  </div>

  <script>
    lucide.createIcons();
  </script>
</body>
</html>